  "definition_recipe": {
    "allocate": "Native candidate.map flag; return current counter and cached allocated core; flag function preserves old flags unless flag is true and slot equals fresh counter. Waiting unchanged. Core allocated inherits ancestry once.",
    "writeSlot": "Raw optional slot lookup.bind old, then NativeIndex.write with references value as gained and references old as lost. No representative resolution of target, no ancestry update.",
    "prepareOrdinary": "Match only ordinary node. Reject terminal-scs bucket; encode.bind handle; allocate.bind allocation pair; writeSlot full scs at allocation.1 and allocation.2; map after to (.hole allocation.1,after). Other value shapes return none."
  },
